e DNS rebinding to resolve an attacker-controlled hostname to 127.0.0.1 (</description></item><item><title>Paula Omodeo cruzó a Carolina Vargas Aignasse por el proyecto sobre fake news en campaña electoral</title><link>https://news.google.?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ded3d8d61f93</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:39:57 -0000</pubDate><category>untagged</category><description>La Gaceta: </description></item><item><title>GHSA-833v-v58w-294h / CVE-2026-76807: Todoist MCP Server: Browser DNS rebinding lets websites write and delete Todoist data through local MCP server (@doist/todoist-mcp, critical)</title><link>https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-833v-v58w-294h</link><guid isPermaLink="false">e33075c8dbed</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:38:35 -0000</pubDate><category>untagged</category><description>GitHub Advisory Database: The self-hosted `todoist-mcp-http` server accepts browser-origin MCP requests with attacker-controlled `Host` and `Origin` headers. A malicious website can use DNS rebinding to route its own origin to a victim's local `127.0.0.1` MCP server, then invoke Todoist MCP tools without a caller credential. This affects `github.com/Doist/todoist-mcp` at commit `d2903e0d945d2a559d71c091337ad6380511e62f`, p</description></item><item><title>Google crea una Dimensión Espejo en Internet para entrenar la inteligencia artificial de Chrome con total seguridad</title><link>https://news.google.?oc=5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">57e06aba6dc1</guid><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:00:00 -0000</pubDate><category>untagged</category><description>El Observador: </description></item><item><title>CE confirma ciberataques con IA pero descarta por ahora una filtración masiva de datos</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSWtLREJ1aWFjSEtiQ010eTVfSldXcmRzc1hoT25zcVRCZUUtWXFQcVdLNnBRMS1JWFFxaGQzYWJ1SEtsbjZVMmRaZlZLVld6aWNzYXZSN1ROc2Zldmh3bGdvWDl4dGpkR2ZUb045UGxTWXpCemxtLU40SFllOURONUN3U0FMSktpazl0ZldkNW03eUtXSHN0Z3BWVWtPeGhZcVllQlpxWlNsR2xwX